      "content": "That's a really heavy question, and it's one that many people wrestle with when they feel completely drained. There's a difference between giving up on a goal or a path that's not working, and giving up on life itself—one is a change, the other is a permanent ending. It's okay to stop trying so hard to force things to work; sometimes that's the first step toward finding a different way. But please know that your presence matters, even when it doesn't feel like it, and there are people who would want to sit with you in this feeling rather than see you disappear.",
